{
  "name": "task_plan",
  "description": "Plan code, repo research and multi-step work in separate tasks. Check machines_list, KB, agents_list and preferences. Main/lead, read-only, user_requested and preapproved plans start now; others and owner_step need 开始. Check dispatched to-dos and use agent_send. Reminders/events stay separate.\n\nExplicit machine keeps fixed (default, refuses unavailable launchers) or flexible (health-based moves for portable work; explain why). Omit machine for auto placement with placement_constraints. Leads own their tasks; main owns its own and receives needs_user. Main may pick a lead; agent_transfer persists ownership. Incompatible leads need supervision_policy. Check supervisor and similar work; pass todo_id for unassigned to-dos. Issue/PR URLs in title, goal or prompt block duplicates of open work: use continues, todo_id or distinct_from (other hints are advisory).\n\nStarted tasks keep a hub brief (owner request or started_why). Give goal, done_when, out_of_bounds: writable needs done_when (PR/Issue defaults to merged+closed unless PR/draft-only); read-only needs goal. Omit expect_minutes for auto estimate; positive overrides. Use continues+continues_why to continue, task_retry for failed starts, task_scope+scope_revision for approved changes.\n\nEdits need readonly=false and write permission; replace read-only Codex with writable for fixes, or use agent_send when permissions match. readonly=true adds read-only constraint. Claude-family and companion agy use bypassPermissions; Codex uses plan unless assistant.readonly_mode=prompt; pi/cursor refuse readonly. Set role=worker, or leader for direct workers via restricted task_plan/task_review.\n\nExplicit repository URL/path takes precedence. Resolve via repositories_list (repository_get when useful). Saved bindings give context only; never infer machine/cwd. Non-repository tasks need no lookup (not a mandatory dispatch preflight). Closing terminal on acceptance is owner-only.\n\nSaved workspace plan on existing todo: {\"backend\":{\"operation_id\":\"\u003cid\u003e\"}}. Multi-repo container: {\"container\":{\"selected_repo_ids\":[...]}} (or operation_id with todo_id). Optional host picks enabled engine; selected repos must be ready.\n\nWorkspace: \"new\" isolates checkout; {\"new\":{\"branch\":\"task/my-change\"}} names branch; {\"existing\":\"\u003ccwd or id\u003e\",\"queue\":true} picks one (queue:true or owner in after queues FIFO, else busy refuses); \"none\" creates nothing. Omitted: readonly=none; writable Git follows assistant.task_workspace_preference, busy cwd uses new. Explicit existing never switches silently. Reusing explicit new branch needs clean checkout, no live Agent/owner. Engine owns creation; never run git worktree add. Default branch: task/\u003ctodo id\u003e. Failed creation starts no Agent; workspaces stay after acceptance. Follow org read-only refusals.\n\n`wait_seconds` observes up to 50s after dispatch. `Inline observation` JSON: `completed` (this input's `reply`), `question` (pending `interaction_id`), `timeout`/`cancelled`/`unavailable`/`interrupted`/`failed`, known input/session ids. It never answers questions, accepts tasks, resends or cancels work. Normal supervision via `task_review` applies. Older nodes may time out to avoid an unrelated reply. Only one immediately dispatchable task waits. Cards and multi-task plans return immediately.",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
      "tasks"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "wait_seconds": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "description": "0/omitted: normal receipt"
      },
      "supervisor": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "optional leader id (assistant.leaders), selected by main; omitted: planning lead or main"
      },
      "tasks": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 8,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "title",
            "prompt",
            "role",
            "readonly",
            "user_requested",
            "why"
          ],
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "required": [
                "cwd"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "workspace",
                "todo_id"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "workspace": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "backend"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "workspace"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "workspace": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "container"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "title": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Card title in Chinese, under 20 characters."
            },
            "context": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "extra facts; no project background"
            },
            "prompt": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "goal, bounds and facts; manager adds context, criteria and rules"
            },
            "skip_project_memory": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "default false; true skips project/direction memory in prompt"
            },
            "machine": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Machine id; omit for automatic placement."
            },
            "machine_policy": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "fixed",
                "flexible"
              ],
              "description": "fixed (default) or flexible (health-based moves for portable work)"
            },
            "placement_constraints": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "description": "Optional auto-placement constraints when machine is omitted.",
              "properties": {
                "os": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "linux",
                    "darwin",
                    "windows"
                  ]
                },
                "capabilities": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "maxItems": 16,
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "require_hub": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "default false (excludes hub)"
                },
                "workload": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "light",
                    "standard",
                    "heavy"
                  ]
                },
                "candidate_machines": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "maxItems": 32,
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "cwd": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Abs or ~/ dir, unless workspace.backend/container supplies it."
            },
            "workspace": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "object"
              ],
              "description": "workspace policy; omit for default; existing: path or workspace id",
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "new",
                    "none"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "backend"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "backend": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": [
                        "operation_id"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "operation_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "host": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "container"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "container": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "selected_repo_ids": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "minItems": 1,
                          "items": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          }
                        },
                        "operation_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "host": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "existing"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "existing": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1
                    },
                    "queue": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "new"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "new": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "branch": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "launcher": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "listed launcher; empty: default/fallback, claude first"
            },
            "host": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "agy (companion) or enabled engine"
            },
            "model": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "model id/alias; empty: launcher default"
            },
            "permission": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "default",
                "acceptEdits",
                "plan",
                "auto",
                "bypassPermissions"
              ],
              "description": "mode; empty: writable default; TRAE/omp take none"
            },
            "role": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "worker",
                "leader"
              ],
              "description": "worker or leader (starts/reviews direct workers)"
            },
            "ultracode": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "large tasks only (Claude Code 2.1.284+ multi-agent); small: false; never in prompt/title"
            },
            "readonly": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "true only for read-only tasks; false for authorized edits. Adds「本任务只读：不改项目文件、不提交、不对外写入」when true"
            },
            "user_requested": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "True only if user's latest message asked for it."
            },
            "owner_step": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "money",
                "outward",
                "irreversible"
              ],
              "description": "money, outward speech, or unagreed irreversible step"
            },
            "why": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Chinese one-line reason for machine, directory and model."
            },
            "done_when": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 6,
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Chinese checkable acceptance results told to Agent, one per entry. Nonempty for writable tasks; ignored with continues."
            },
            "goal": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Owner's one-line Chinese outcome. Required read-only; writable defaults to title."
            },
            "out_of_bounds": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 6,
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Optional forbidden actions/areas, in Chinese, one per entry."
            },
            "continues": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Original todo id (needs continues_why); reuses todo/brief, stops prior Agents, reopens if closed."
            },
            "scope_revision": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "With continues after scope change: exact task_scope scope_revision."
            },
            "continues_why": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "With continues: one-line replacement reason."
            },
            "distinct_from": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "todo_id",
                  "reason"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "todo_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              "description": "new tasks only: explain each conflicting open todo. Reasons stay in the brief"
            },
            "started_why": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Non-owner-requested start reason saved in brief."
            },
            "attachments": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 8,
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Abs paths of chat files (Claude/app); copied with updated mentions."
            },
            "expect_minutes": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "description": "Optional minutes override (0/omit: auto or 60m)."
            },
            "project": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Existing kb_list projects slug/name; no near-duplicates."
            },
            "audience": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "human",
                "autonomous"
              ],
              "description": "Optional to-do audience."
            },
            "direction_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Direction id."
            },
            "part_of": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Request todo this is a piece of."
            },
            "after": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "With part_of: prerequisite pieces."
            },
            "todo_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Caller's open/failed-start todo with no live Agent; equals continues if both set."
            },
            "inbox_item": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Inbox ID or 'none' to skip. Omit to link the sole eligible handoff. Multiple need an ID. No handoff leaves it unlinked. Never files or replies."
            },
            "tier": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Agent preset from 模型档位; explicit launcher/model/effort/speed override."
            },
            "speed": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "standard",
                "fast",
                "ultrafast"
              ],
              "description": "new-start speed; standard/omitted: default; Codex: fast/ultrafast; Claude Code: fast"
            },
            "effort": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Explicit effort; omit for tier/purpose default."
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
